# 统一行尾：仓库内一律 LF，避免 Windows 上 checkout 成 CRLF 后
# gofmt/go vet 把每个 .go 文件都判为「未格式化」（Windows CI 首次运行正是这样全红的）。
* text=auto eol=lf

*.go        text eol=lf
*.md        text eol=lf
*.yml       text eol=lf
*.yaml      text eol=lf
*.json      text eol=lf
*.txt       text eol=lf
*.js        text eol=lf
*.css       text eol=lf
*.html      text eol=lf
*.manifest  text eol=lf
*.mod       text eol=lf
*.sum       text eol=lf

# Windows 批处理必须 CRLF，否则 cmd.exe 可能解析异常
*.bat       text eol=crlf
*.cmd       text eol=crlf
*.ps1       text eol=crlf

# 二进制不做行尾转换
*.png       binary
*.jpg       binary
*.ico       binary
*.syso      binary
*.zip       binary
*.gz        binary
*.tar       binary
*.exe       binary
*.db        binary
